    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No More Deep</strong> is a first-person shooter and puzzle-solving survival horror game that tells a bizarre yet captivating story.<br><br>In the game, you play as Jack, returns to his long-lost hometown and encounters the dismembered ancient goddess, Elsalia. She pleads with you to help her reclaim her beauty, sanity, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.poster.avif?t=1752646155\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.webm?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.mp4?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Collect resources and craft a variety of unique items to survive in this world. <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.poster.avif?t=1752646155\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.webm?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.mp4?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience immersive horror through <strong>seamless transitions</strong> between CG and first-person gameplay. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/f8c66fe64de3bcb33a0ff4285e434801.poster.avif?t=1752646155\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/f8c66fe64de3bcb33a0ff4285e434801.webm?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/f8c66fe64de3bcb33a0ff4285e434801.mp4?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Immerse yourself in a <strong>cinematic, dramatic storyline</strong> experience.<br><br><br><strong>Story Summary\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wenster Town was once a flourishing settlement renowned far and wide, but after a meteorite incident, it faded into oblivion. When the protagonist, Jack, returns to the town that raised him, he discovers everything has changed. The village haunted by creatures known as \u201cWorm-Men\u201d. He meets a beautiful woman named Asalia, who claims to be the \u201cgoddess\u201d of the town\u2014yet she seems deeply intertwined with the \u201cWorm-Men\u201d. What force turned this prosperous hometown into a desolate ruin? What secrets lie behind Asalia? And what is the\u201cWorm-Men\u201d? Players will guide Jack through the abandoned streets and the hidden world within, facing horrifying creatures and mysterious powers to unveil the secrets buried for so many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive bodycam system that delivers an exceptionally realistic horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinctively designed Victorian Gothic town created with Unreal Engine 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest UE5 MetaHuman technology, bringing the protagonist to life with realistic facial expressions and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, adrenaline-pumping combat against a variety of monsters and formidable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive clue-inspection, item-inspection, and assembly systems, plus robust resource gathering and allocation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive dialogue system offering an RPG-like experience, where different choices lead to various quest outcomes<br><br>The game is developed independent by myself from idea to package. I only got help from one of my artist friend. If you like this game, feel free to follow my social media in the steampage.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No More Deep</strong> is a first-person shooter and puzzle-solving survival horror game that tells a bizarre yet captivating story.<br><br>In the game, you play as Jack, returns to his long-lost hometown and encounters the dismembered ancient goddess, Elsalia. She pleads with you to help her reclaim her beauty, sanity, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.poster.avif?t=1752646155\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.webm?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/d3030f3b458fd4270d3882db86145eba.mp4?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Collect resources and craft a variety of unique items to survive in this world. <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.poster.avif?t=1752646155\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.webm?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434670/extras/756023e1608487d31e44cbb04fbb4a99.mp4?t=1752646155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience immersive horror through <strong>seamless transitions</strong> between CG and first-person gameplay. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht