at against a variety of monsters and formidable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive clue-inspection, item-inspection, and assembly systems, plus robust resource gathering and allocation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive dialogue system offering an RPG-like experience, where different choices lead to various quest outcomes<br><br>The game is developed independent by myself from idea to package. I only got help from one of my artist friend. If you like this game, feel free to follow my social media in the steampage.</p></li></ul>",
